NOTE ON DATA (not covered by the MIT licence above)

This MIT licence covers the CODE in this repository only. It does NOT cover the
DATA this pipeline fetches, stores, or publishes. That data is licensed
separately and PER SOURCE — each row in the database carries its own `license`,
`license_url`, and `attribution`, and the project-level data licence is
therefore mixed.

Most sources are all-rights-reserved official/website content (not open-data
datasets): for these the full text is indexed for search only, with
`can_store_fulltext = 0`, and the served output is an AI summary plus a link and
attribution to the official source — never the official word, and never legal
advice. See the "Licensing & redistribution posture" section of README.md for
details. This is a compliance posture, not a legal conclusion, and should be
reviewed by a Singapore-qualified lawyer before launch.
